#reverse of an array
reversing the array by using for loop
##features
-asking user for the array size and array elements
-accessing the array elements using
> for(i=0;i<array size ;i++)
-printing the array elements before reversing
> for(i=0;i<array size ;i++)
-printing array elements in reverse order
> for(i=n-1;i<=0;i--)
###sample output
-enter the array size
> 5
-enter the array elements
> 1
> 2
> 3
> 4
> 5
-elements of an array before reversing
> 1
> 2
> 3
> 4
> 5
-elements of an array after reversing
> 5
> 4
> 3
> 2
> 1
####language
java
